316 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (Q: Looking back on your time with Ashwa Racing, what were some key technical or hands-on experiences that significantly influenced your approach to engineering today?)
/E (Q: Looking back on your time with Ashwa Racing, what were some key technical or hands-on experiences that significantly influenced your approach to engineering today?)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
317 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Due to the smaller team size of Moto Student, the seniors' and our team were merged together. I at the time was helping out a bit on the chassis design and loads simulation. And I learnt that sometime you need the big picture of the entire system. If you start working with narrow vision, you'd lose out on optimizing and improving the system as a whole. One small change locally would mess up the global system. )
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [2 3]
>>
endobj
