321 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Q: Were there any specific challenges or projects you tackled at Ashwa Racing that pushed you to grow, either technically or personally? How did you overcome them?)
/E (Q: Were there any specific challenges or projects you tackled at Ashwa Racing that pushed you to grow, either technically or personally? How did you overcome them?)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
322 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E ( When we were trying to reach out to sponsors, I was helping out a few of the SMP with shortlisting and participating in the meetings together. )
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [1 2]
>>
endobj
323 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (During this I learnt that there's always a way to grow and learn. When we were in the sale's pitch meetings with the sponsors, we were always learning and finding new opportunities, the sales representative would sometimes explain a better way to have designed the component that we would be proposing .)
/Pg 18 0 R
>>
endobj
324 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Q: How did being part of a collaborative, multidisciplinary team like Ashwa shape your problem-solving or communication skills in your current role?)
/E (Q: How did being part of a collaborative, multidisciplinary team like Ashwa shape your problem-solving or communication skills in your current role?)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
325 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Looking back, there was a time when during the phrase A for the moto student contest we were running a little late on our designs. This was during when we barely had people for the team already and as such there were very few people in the Moto Student team. I managed to get the entire team to help each other out a lot. And thereby we were able to clear the phase 1 evaluation. )
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [4 5]
>>
endobj
326 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (This helped me improve a lot of my soft skills, because, co-ordination between everyone was key and maintaining that was quite hard)
/Pg 18 0 R
>>
endobj
